{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 151026, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 100827, "uid": 94239, "type": 4, "title": "光艳后技能改版大加强", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1645178359, "updated_at": 1645178715, "updated_uid": 94239, "comment_at": 1652235589, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "现在的水RAID送以往的boss，想高加艳后的千万不要错过了。NS：暗属性的敌方优先、2体3037伤害、对方是暗属性时、986的追加伤害&2回合内、90%的概率集中&20秒間、92.8%的概率无视反射", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 1, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 4723, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 151026, "content": "<div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:20px;\">现在的水RAID送以往的boss，想高加艳后的千万不要错过了。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">NS：<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">暗属性的敌方优先、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: 700;\">2体</span></span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: 700;\">3037</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">伤害、对方是暗属性时、</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: 700;\">986</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的追加伤害&amp;</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: 700;\">2</span></span><span style=\"\">回合</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">内、</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: 700;\">90%</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的概率集中&amp;</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\">20</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">秒間、</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\">92.8%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的概率无视反射</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"\">只要1次点火就有质变，13秒集中变为两回合集中，婚巴要打DS，而且只有25秒。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"\">附带的反射无视，在星云和PVP中也非常适合。</span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">SS：<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">HP剩余最少的敌方优先、</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: blue;\">4体</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: blue;\">4756</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的伤害&amp;</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: blue;\">2605</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的防御无视、</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\">8</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">秒内、诅咒</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&amp;暴击时、技能槽最多的敌方2体</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\">95.2%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">的概率</span><span class=\"bolder\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: red;\">4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">秒内、气绝</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4连虽然不多，也比婚巴多了一下。附带的特效在PVP也不错。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\">PVP：个人认为这把刀和光狗不相上下，就算不拿来打输出，4体的气绝+诅咒还是非常香的。如果在乱斗能保护好艳后，相信能有很高的输出和控制。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\">RAID：暗RAID无疑是第一人（只要不BAN集中）</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\">WB：输出肯定比不上百分比刀</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\">总结：暗RAID冲榜的是肯定要点的；如果没点光狗的还是先点光狗，更泛用。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"fon